.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2012-a-derelict-1866-washington-house-was-listed-on-a-waterfront-lot-worth-more-without-it-preservationists-spent-6-years-buying-it-and-8-more-restoring-it-before-reopening-it-in-2026/articleshow/133649648.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2012-a-derelict-1866-washington-house-was-listed-on-a-waterfront-lot-worth-more-without-it-preservationists-spent-6-years-buying-it-and-8-more-restoring-it-before-reopening-it-in-2026/articleshow/133649648.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-01T14:31:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133649791,imgsize-107952.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Florida clock restored after nearly a century outdoors in a painstaking 700-hour project]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133672422.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In Clearwater, Florida, a remarkable four-faced clock has undergone an impressive restoration, thanks to clockmaker David H. Boyd, who dedicated 700 hours to the project. He skillfully preserved the original dial and hands while integrating new clockworks. This iconic timepiece now proudly graces Cleveland Street again, bridging the city’s rich history with contemporary usability.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-florida-clock-survived-nearly-a-century-outdoors-one-clockmaker-has-now-spent-about-700-hours-restoring-its-95-year-old-hands-dial-and-metalwork/articleshow/133672422.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-florida-clock-survived-nearly-a-century-outdoors-one-clockmaker-has-now-spent-about-700-hours-restoring-its-95-year-old-hands-dial-and-metalwork/articleshow/133672422.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-01T14:30:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133672896,imgsize-911618.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[This Texas basin was once called a ‘graveyard’ but now supports 853,924 jobs]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133670647.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/this-texas-basin-was-once-dismissed-as-a-graveyard-now-its-oil-economy-supports-853924-jobs-and-generates-billions-in-economic-activity-across-the-us/articleshow/133670647.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/this-texas-basin-was-once-dismissed-as-a-graveyard-now-its-oil-economy-supports-853924-jobs-and-generates-billions-in-economic-activity-across-the-us/articleshow/133670647.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-01T16:40:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133674716,imgsize-2100066.cms"/></item></channel></rss>